  m_Text: "MOVE\n   W A S D   or   Arrow Keys\n   Left stick on a gamepad\n\nTHAT
    IS THE WHOLE CONTROL SCHEME.\nTwo action buttons maximum is a hard rule,\nand
    Red Light does not need either of them.\n\nMove on GO. Freeze on STOP.\nBarnaby
    is biased and he lies."
